---
description: >-
  Develop-branch-with-merge scenario (develop is merged back into main) with `showBranches: true`,
  verifying branch lines remain visible through and after a merge commit.
config:
  gitGraph:
    showBranches: true
    showCommitLabel: true
    rotateCommitLabel: false
    parallelCommits: false
---
